Z||000000||CoolBlue87GT||12-25-2001||11:59 AM||||I dropped my Fiero off at a local paint shop, just to have one little rock chip touched up.<P>When I returned, they had painted the whole car by mistake and it looked like crap.<P>The finish looked like it was painted outside, and a sand storm came up.<P>I was so upset, I was yelling at the painter and really going off on him.<P>Oh my God, I woke up screaming.  I could see the whole thing just like real life. Colors & all.<P>When I got up, I went out to the garage to check it out.  Good news, it was a bad dream.<P>It was really scary !||||reg||11
Z||000001||FieroMontreal||12-25-2001||12:32 PM||||OMG!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><P>good thing it was only a dream... now now calm down coolblue...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR> -Alex <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigfieromontrealholidays.gif"> <BR>1986 Fiero GT, STOCK Wingless, <BR>President of FieroMontreal... <A HREF="http://www.fieromontreal.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieromontreal.com</A> <BR>and Regional Director of CFOG-I for Eastern Canada.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Spiff||12-25-2001||01:52 PM||||Calm down. Take a deep breath. Now count to ten. Feel better? I was only a dream. Well actually a nightmare. But remember, It was not real.<P>Merry Christmas<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/spiffsig2_18.gif"> ||||reg||1
