Z||000006||stingant0||12-25-2001||06:40 PM||||What your dream seems to telling you is that don't trust someone. Is there someone that that you trust, but you have an uneasiness about them? Dream usually occur one to two days after the incident, has anything happen or have you trusted someone in the past week? Dreams are your heart trying to tell your mind what to do (Ann Faraday). She says to think with your heart not your mind.<BR> Tonight before you go to bed tell yourself that you will wake up whenever you dream (you ONLY remember the dreams you wake during). Then write the dreams down on a paper.... Believe me this works!!! tell me tomarrow to the next day if it works for you...<BR>||||reg||1
